      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "2"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/475/2"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28dcf6e80308c9ad0b138928",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "海鲜高汤与猪背脂的浓汤是其特色。\\n极粗面与散发海潮香的岩海苔风味充满魅力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a6b5d01fcc2892fd5f64c1fcfcc1a64573fbe2af67db3d681ad29e8d70e9712",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "3"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/475/3"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9da900a53735521ddf1f807c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "清淡好下口的酱油汤底，\\n和Q弹面条相性拔群的一碗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1e4cdc017e453f41cb7cbc2b90656929a3a139b7a009db0e9b3b5467867d524",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "4"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/475/4"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e620ebcdd25eeecbee994f48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "极粗面和浓厚酱油风味的豚骨汤底，\\n厚切猪肉和堆积如山的蔬菜极具压迫感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2c4a3e0d5d04de11a935b9ddd0ec5c87084d16c7a436737275bbc054c255b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "475",
        "5"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/475/5"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845ad165eb7dbb9b547e5265",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "叉烧肉汁与酱油调制的\\n汤底是其特色。用作佐料的洋葱带来清爽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8c6c7a5c570600153fa0c075c6bbe85b09ff083e65dea6f4d05a1cd0f17f46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
